# BluOS Controller

This repository is **BluOS Controller**. Use these names only:

| Kind | Name |
|------|------|
| Product | BluOS Controller |
| GitHub / package / CLI | `bluos-controller` |
| Classes | `BluOSController`, `BluOSCLI` |
| Logger | `BluOS` |
| Env vars | `BLUOS_DEBUG`, `BLUOS_STRUCTURED_LOG` |
| Config / logs | `~/.config/bluos-controller/` |
| Keychain service | `bluos-controller` |
| Temp discovery files | `.bluos-tmp-discovery-*` |

Do not introduce other product or package names. The official API PDF host `bluesoundprofessional.com` is an external vendor URL and must stay unchanged.
